  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create invitation  ⭐",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/invitations",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "invitations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**⭐ Join flow test korte age eita chalao.**\n\n**Ki kore:** Invite code banay. Response-e plaintext `code` ase — **eibar-i sudhu**, database-e shudhu SHA-256 hash thake.\n\n**Field gulo:**\n- `role` — join kore ke ki role pabe. **OWNER dewa jabe na** (`400`) — ownership shudhu transfer diye jay\n- `maxUses` — koyjon ei code use korte parbe\n\n**Ke parbe:** OWNER / MANAGER.\n\n**Expect:** `201`. Code ta auto-save hobe `inviteCode` variable-e.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"MEMBER\",\n  \"expiresInHours\": 72,\n  \"maxUses\": 5\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"inviteCode\", pm.response.json().data.code);\ntry { pm.environment.set(\"inviteCode\", pm.response.json().data.code); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
              "console.log(\"Invite code:\", pm.response.json().data.code);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "List active invitations",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/invitations",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "invitations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Ekhono valid (expire hoyni, revoke hoyni) invite gulo dekhay — koybar use hoyeche seta soho.\n\n**Note:** code plaintext ekhane ashbe na, karon server-er kacheo nei — shudhu hash ache.\n\n**Expect:** `200`"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const i = pm.response.json().data[0];",
              "if (i) {",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"invitationId\", i.id);",
              "try { pm.environment.set(\"invitationId\", i.id); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
