        "description": "**Ki kore:** Login chharai code ta ki jinish dekhay — kon mess, ki role, kobe expire.\n\n**Kokhon lagbe:** Join page-e user ke dekhanor jonno \"tumi Shanti Mess-e MEMBER hisebe join korcho\" — join kore felar age.\n\n**Cheshta koro:** ulto-palta code dao (`XXXXXXXX`) — `404`. Expired code dile `409`.\n\n**Expect:** `200`",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": [],
