        "description": "**Ki kore:** Logged-in user ke oi mess-e add kore.\n\n**Race-safe:** usage counter guarded `updateMany` diye bare, tai single-use code duijon ek sathe use korle **ekjon-i** paray — duijon-i na.\n\n**Purono member firle:** age REMOVED howa keu abar join korle eki row-te fire ase, tai tar purono hisheb harai na.\n\n**Expect:** `201`",
