    {
      "name": "List members",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/members?page=1&limit=20",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "members"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "page",
              "value": "1",
              "description": "Kon page (default 1)"
            },
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "20",
              "description": "Prati page-e koyta (max 100)"
            },
            {
              "key": "search",
              "value": "",
              "description": "Naam ba email diye khojo",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "status",
              "value": "",
              "description": "ACTIVE / INACTIVE / INVITED / REMOVED",
              "disabled": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Member list — pagination, search ar filter soho.\n\n**Ke parbe:** MANAGER+ (Accountant read korte pare). **MEMBER ba COOK cheshta korle `403`.**\n\n**Default:** REMOVED member gulo baad jay, jodi na `status=REMOVED` dao.\n\n**Expect:** `200` + `meta` object-e total/totalPages."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const list = pm.response.json().data;",
              "const other = list.find(m => m.id !== pm.variables.get(\"membershipId\"));",
              "if (other) {",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"targetMembershipId\", other.id);",
              "try { pm.environment.set(\"targetMembershipId\", other.id); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
              "  console.log(\"target member:\", other.user.name);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Change member role (OWNER only)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/members/{{targetMembershipId}}/role",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "members",
            "{{targetMembershipId}}",
            "role"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Kono member-er role bodlay.\n\n**Ke parbe:** **shudhu OWNER**. Manager cheshta korleo `403`.\n\n**Rule:** OWNER-er role ei route diye bodlano jabe na (`403`) — tar jonno \"Transfer ownership\" ache. Karon owner-ke demote korle mess-e kono owner thakbe na.\n\n**Expect:** `200`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"ACCOUNTANT\",\n  \"reason\": \"Taking over the monthly accounts\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
